// Launcher tools localization.
"Controller vibration test" = "手柄震动自测";
"Choose a test. Each effect lasts one second." = "请选择测试，每次持续 1 秒。";
"Connect your controller, then return here." = "请先连接手柄，再返回这里。";
"This controller does not expose that vibration output." = "系统未提供此手柄的对应震动输出。";
"The system could not create a controller haptics engine." = "系统无法创建手柄震动引擎。";
"Playing for one second…" = "正在测试震动，持续 1 秒……";
"The system accepted the request. Did the controller vibrate?" = "系统已接受播放请求。刚才手柄有震动吗？";
"Vibration test failed" = "震动测试失败";
"Recorded: vibration felt." = "已记录：手柄有震动。";
"Recorded: no vibration felt." = "已记录：手柄没有震动。";
"No controller connected" = "未连接手柄";
"Controller" = "手柄";
"Controller type" = "手柄类型";
"No vibration outputs reported" = "系统未报告震动输出能力";
"Refresh controllers" = "刷新手柄";
"Test normal vibration" = "测试常规震动（1 秒）";
"Test left motor" = "测试左侧马达（1 秒）";
"Test right motor" = "测试右侧马达（1 秒）";
"Stop vibration" = "停止震动";
"Each test runs at full strength for one second, independently of game rumble settings." = "每次以最大强度测试 1 秒，独立于游戏内的震动开关。";
"I felt vibration" = "刚才有震动";
"I felt no vibration" = "完全没有震动";
"Results are written to log.txt. An accepted request does not confirm physical vibration." = "测试和反馈会写入 log.txt。系统接受请求不代表手柄实际产生了震动。";
"Start game vibration comparison" = "开始游戏震动对照测试";
"Keep Bluetooth connected. After each one-second test, record whether you felt vibration to continue." = "保持蓝牙连接。每项测试持续 1 秒，结束后选择是否有震动，再进入下一项。";
"A: One-shot baseline" = "A：一次性震动（基准）";
"B: Continuous event" = "B：连续震动";
"C: Dynamic parameters" = "C：连续震动并调整强度";
"D: Previous muted startup" = "D：旧版游戏的静音启动方式";
"E: Parameters before startup" = "E：先设置强度再启动";
"F: Actual game adapter" = "F：游戏原有适配代码";
"Vibration felt" = "有震动";
"No vibration felt" = "无震动";
"Did the controller vibrate during this test?" = "刚才这一项测试，手柄有震动吗？";
"Comparison complete. Results are saved in log.txt." = "对照测试完成，结果已保存到 log.txt。";
