"New residents use an existing empty housing plot." = "新岛民会入住已有的空住宅用地。";
"Replacement keeps the house, decorations and friendship. Deletion leaves an empty plot. Keep at least two residents." = "替换会保留住宅、装修和好感记录；删除后保留空地。岛上至少保留两位动物岛民。";
"A full save backup is created before every change. Changes apply when you start the game." = "每次修改前自动备份完整存档，启动游戏后生效。";
"Start the game and create an island save before using the manager." = "请先进入游戏并建立岛屿存档，再使用岛民管理。";
"The house, decorations and friendship will be kept." = "保留原住宅、装修和好感记录。";
"This animal will leave the island. The housing plot remains available." = "这位动物会离开岛屿，原来的住宅位置将保留为空地。";
"Restore the entire island, including player progress, to this backup. Your current save will be backed up first." = "将整座岛屿和玩家进度恢复到此备份，恢复前会先备份当前存档。";
"Saved. Start the game to see your changes." = "已保存，启动游戏后即可查看。";
"The current save could not be opened. You can restore a complete backup. The current files will be preserved first." = "当前存档无法读取，可以从完整备份恢复。恢复前会先保留当前文件。";
"The current files will be preserved separately before restoring a complete backup." = "恢复完整备份前，会另外保留当前文件。";
"Restore the entire island, including player progress, to this backup. The unreadable current files will be preserved separately first." = "将整座岛屿和玩家进度恢复到此备份。恢复前会另外保留当前无法读取的文件。";
"The resident catalog is missing or incompatible." = "动物名单缺失或版本不兼容。";
"This editor supports only Animal Crossing 3.0.3 saves." = "此功能仅支持动森 3.0.3 的存档。";
"The save failed its integrity check. No changes were written." = "存档完整性校验未通过，没有写入修改。";
"The save changed since it was opened. Close and reopen the manager." = "存档已经发生变化，请关闭并重新打开岛民管理。";
"This resident selection is invalid." = "此岛民选择无效。";
"This animal already lives on the island." = "这位动物已经住在岛上。";
"The island already has 10 animal residents." = "岛上已经有 10 位动物岛民。";
"Place an empty housing plot in the game before adding a resident." = "请先在游戏内放置空住宅用地，再新增岛民。";
"Keep the two starting residents until the island has progressed further." = "请先保留两位初始岛民，继续推进岛屿建设。";
"Finish the current move or building relocation in the game first." = "请先在游戏内完成当前搬家或房屋迁移。";
